WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.728 --> 00:00:14.389
was lying awake in the dark in the bedroom he shared with Sid.

2
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:17.070
He couldn't understand Becky's anger.

3
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.092
Suddenly he heard a familiar "me-e-e-ow-w" coming from outside.

4
00:00:23.132 --> 00:00:29.975
As planned, Huck had arrived at Tom's house a little before midnight, and he'd given the secret call.

5
00:00:30.275 --> 00:00:31.336
Tom meowed back.

6
00:00:33.284 --> 00:00:36.066
Tom climbed out his bedroom window and joined Huck on the street.

7
00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:40.029
The two boys then hurried to the graveyard to cure their warts.

8
00:00:40.829 --> 00:00:43.811
The graveyard was on a hill about a mile and a half from the town.

9
00:00:44.872 --> 00:00:47.754
It was quiet, except for the wind whistling through the trees.

10
00:00:47.774 --> 00:00:52.557
"Here is Hoss' grave," said Huck.

11
00:00:53.798 --> 00:00:55.199
"Shouldn't we call him Mr.

12
00:00:55.299 --> 00:00:56.940
Williams?" asked Tom.

13
00:00:57.661 --> 00:01:01.223
Tom wasn't sure if it was polite for kids to call a dead man by his first name.

14
00:01:01.243 --> 00:01:03.484
"You're right," said Huck.

15
00:01:03.504 --> 00:01:05.445
"The dead should be respected."

16
00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:09.426
"What do we use to cure our warts?"

17
00:01:09.946 --> 00:01:10.526
asked Tom.

18
00:01:10.546 --> 00:01:15.868
"Indian herbs, and they're over there," said Huck, pointing to a large tree.

19
00:01:16.888 --> 00:01:18.708
Tom followed Huck over to the large tree.

20
00:01:19.629 --> 00:01:21.769
Suddenly Tom and Huck heard muffled voices.

21
00:01:22.869 --> 00:01:26.750
The boys froze, sure that the voices belonged to dead spirits who were angry.

22
00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:32.372
"I've heard that spirits can see in the dark, like cats," whispered Huck.

23
00:01:33.064 --> 00:01:33.925
"What should we do?"

24
00:01:34.846 --> 00:01:36.968
There was a light, and the voices grew louder.

25
00:01:36.988 --> 00:01:42.072
"Huck, they're not spirits, they're people," whispered Tom.

26
00:01:42.092 --> 00:01:43.894
"And I know them.

27
00:01:44.775 --> 00:01:49.459
One is Muff Potter, another is Injun Joe, and there's Doc Robinson!"

28
00:01:51.201 --> 00:01:54.143
Tom and Huck hid in the shadow of the big tree, and watched.

29
00:01:54.163 --> 00:01:57.186
"Hurry, men," said Doc Robinson.

30
00:01:57.206 --> 00:01:58.948
"The moon might come out."

31
00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:03.722
Muff Potter and Injun Joe began digging as Doc Robinson held the lantern.

32
00:02:04.543 --> 00:02:07.084
It didn't take long before one of the shovels hit the coffin.

33
00:02:09.305 --> 00:02:12.027
Muff and Injun Joe used their shovels to open the coffin.

34
00:02:12.047 --> 00:02:17.070
"You'd better give us another five dollars," said Muff Potter.

35
00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.611
"Or the body stays here."

36
00:02:20.572 --> 00:02:21.672
The doctor was angry.

37
00:02:21.692 --> 00:02:23.853
"Look here," he said.

38
00:02:23.873 --> 00:02:25.774
"I paid you in advance."

39
00:02:26.735 --> 00:02:31.702
Injun Joe approached him and said, "Your father put me in jail, and I swore I'd get even.

40
00:02:32.202 --> 00:02:33.243
Did you think I'd forget?"

41
00:02:34.944 --> 00:02:36.986
Injun Joe threatened the doctor with his fist.

42
00:02:37.806 --> 00:02:43.050
Doc Robinson slowly put the lantern down, and then turned suddenly and hit Injun Joe in the face.

43
00:02:44.231 --> 00:02:47.793
Muff ran to help his friend, but he was too drunk to hurt Doc Robinson.

44
00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:51.516
Muff took a swing at the doctor, missed, and lost his balance.

45
00:02:53.717 --> 00:02:56.840
Doc Robinson picked up a rock and hit the stumbling Muff on the head.

46
00:02:57.948 --> 00:03:02.271
As Muff fell to the ground, Injun Joe pulled out a knife and drove it into the doctor's

47
00:03:02.351 --> 00:03:07.135
chest. Injun Joe then took the knife and put it in Muff Potter's hand.

48
00:03:08.376 --> 00:03:10.857
Finally he robbed Doc Robinson's dead body.

49
00:03:15.421 --> 00:03:17.142
The boys couldn't believe what they had seen.

50
00:03:18.343 --> 00:03:21.065
The graveyard was an evil place, and they ran from it.

51
00:03:21.985 --> 00:03:25.428
In the dark the boys thought for sure that the spirits of the dead were chasing them.

52
00:03:26.656 --> 00:03:28.257
"We've got to make it to the old barn!"

53
00:03:29.879 --> 00:03:31.300
shouted Tom between breaths.

54
00:03:32.041 --> 00:03:33.102
There was no answer.

55
00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:35.504
Huck could only gasp for breath.

56
00:03:37.646 --> 00:03:41.189
The boys kept running and soon they burst through the open barn door.

57
00:03:41.209 --> 00:03:43.751
"Huck, what's going to happen?"

58
00:03:44.172 --> 00:03:44.772
asked Tom.

59
00:03:44.792 --> 00:03:49.436
"Doc Robinson is dead, so there will be a hanging," replied Huck.

60
00:03:49.456 --> 00:03:53.280
"And if Injun Joe finds out we saw, he'll kill us for sure!"

61
00:03:54.356 --> 00:03:57.698
"There will be a hanging only if we tell," said Tom.

62
00:03:57.718 --> 00:03:59.378
"Muff was knocked out.

63
00:03:59.898 --> 00:04:01.199
He didn't see what happened."

64
00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.900
"Tom, that's it," said Huck.

65
00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.682
"If we swear to keep quiet, Injun Joe won't kill us."

66
00:04:08.842 --> 00:04:11.584
It was almost morning when Tom got home and crawled into bed.

67
00:04:13.064 --> 00:04:16.206
Huck had no home to go to so he slept inside an empty barrel.

68
00:04:18.527 --> 00:04:21.388
The next morning everyone heard the news that the doctor was dead.

69
00:04:22.568 --> 00:04:26.451
A public hearing was scheduled, and the sheriff and mayor asked people what they knew.

70
00:04:27.531 --> 00:04:30.093
Both Muff Potter and Injun Joe were questioned.

71
00:04:30.994 --> 00:04:33.155
Muff said he was too drunk to remember what happened.

72
00:04:33.756 --> 00:04:36.177
But he admitted going to the graveyard to rob the grave.

73
00:04:37.838 --> 00:04:41.621
When Injun Joe was questioned, he said that it was Muff who had killed the doctor.

74
00:04:42.541 --> 00:04:46.184
So the sheriff took Muff Potter to jail, and Injun Joe remained free.

75
00:04:46.944 --> 00:04:52.088
Huck and Tom couldn't believe that Injun Joe could tell such lies, and Tom often had nightmares.

76
00:04:52.852 --> 00:04:56.340
He dreamed of the murder, and of Injun Joe coming after him in his dreams.

77
00:04:58.123 --> 00:05:03.535
Later Tom remembered that he and Huck had left something behind in the graveyard—the bag of Indian herbs.
